<title>TAIWAN: TAIWAN CK GROUP TO TENDER FOR 54,000T U.S. CORN.</title>
<headline>TAIWAN CK GROUP TO TENDER FOR 54,000T U.S. CORN.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's CK group will tender on Thursday for 54,000 tonnes of U.S. No.2 corn, traders said on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>The CK Group comprises Chia Hsin Flour Feed and Vegetable Oil Corp and some buyers from Taiwan's southern port city of Kaohsiung.</p>
<p>Details for the tender are as follows:</p>
<p>Tonnes  Date/Location</p>
<p>	   U.S. Gulf	Pacific Northwest</p>
<p> 54,000  Oct 25-Nov 8   Nov 9-Nov 24</p>
<p>-- Taipei newsroom (886) 2-508-0815; Fax (886) 2-508-0204</p>
